# once, a live holder is respected with one "skipped" line, and the refresh is
# never skipped silently. Measured on yoga 2026-11-02: a leaked lock disabled
# the refresh for an hour with no lifecycle line. The arms execute the real
# ensure_forge_harnesses cut out of images/default/lib-common.sh; no npm, no
# podman, no network.
#
# STEP_LUA is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
